{"mechanism_id":"M01","mechanism":"本人不实回访","file_id":"F006818","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F006818-88b20cdff16a126c391eef32","quote":"诱导投保人不如实回答回访问题","quote_span":{"start":114,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"个人代理人诱导投保人本人对回访问题不如实回答。","limitations":"公开表未列具体回访问题、指示话术和保单条件；不能据此推定他人代接。","event_family_id":"FEV-82988aa8508dac5444a7","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M01","mechanism":"本人不实回访","file_id":"F008984","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F008984-119a73c56a6773c4aeaafdac","quote":"阻碍投保人接受回访,诱导投保人不接\n受回访或者不如实回答回访","quote_span":{"start":174,"end":204,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"机构被记载阻碍投保人回访，并诱导不接受回访或者不如实回答。","limitations":"原文为不接访或不实回答的并列／择一概括，未拆分次数与具体脚本，不据此证明每种动作均逐笔发生。","event_family_id":"FEV-faf90e3afd510f4be1ca","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M02","mechanism":"冒充回访","file_id":"F001774","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F001774-4e335999b3c708419a9dbb1a","quote":"1.电话回访存在由保险营销员、银保客户经理及其亲属或公司内部员工代替投保人接受回访现象。\n2.上门回访存在银保客户经理代替投保人在回访问卷上签名现象。","quote_span":{"start":149,"end":224,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"营销员、银保经理及其亲属或内部员工代投保人接受电话回访，另有经理代签上门回访问卷。","limitations":"对象是他人代接／代签，不是指导投保人本人不实作答。","event_family_id":"FEV-d419af9385c71456eabe","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M02","mechanism":"冒充回访","file_id":"F001837","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F001837-fb6c9de9418d953ac195152e","quote":"部分承保资料中回访电话为个险营销人员电话,存在个险营销人员代替投保人接受回访的问题。","quote_span":{"start":137,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"部分保单将营销人员电话作为回访电话，并由营销人员替投保人接受回访。","limitations":"未记具体冒充问答、客户知情与否，不泛化为所有回访均由他人代接。","event_family_id":"FEV-889f2e197e9e4dcbc96b","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M02","mechanism":"冒充回访","file_id":"F001715","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F001715-2fd1c91328823370803de187","quote":"为了不让投保人在犹豫期内发现被隐瞒的情况,张刚在投保单(公司留存联)上将投保人电话号码填写为自己的电话号码,代替投保人接受保单销售回访。","quote_span":{"start":310,"end":378,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"销售人员把公司留存联的投保人电话填写为自己电话，代投保人接受回访以掩盖交费情况。","limitations":"为特定保单的代接；不是本人按脚本回答。","event_family_id":"FEV-80490f4154ce89f3e3b0","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M03","mechanism":"绝对避债／避税承诺","file_id":"F002283","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F002283-45c950ef0706cc4549835905","quote":"它合理合法,各位可以拿它避债避税","quote_span":{"start":631,"end":647,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"产品说明会讲师将保险宣传为可合法避债避税。","limitations":"仅支撑无条件泛称避债避税的宣传风险；未述债务或税种的具体适用，不推定任何债务均可隔离。同F002284一事件。","event_family_id":"FEV-c2eac4fc80e55f233c06","event_family_status":"supported_same_event","previous_anchor_overlap":true,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":true,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
