{"mechanism_id":"M04","mechanism":"合同外利益","file_id":"F000390","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F000390-401db2f74ca1b607a8db1955","quote":"2017年至2018年5月,以赠送油卡和代金券的方式,向通过你公司保险兼业代理渠道购买车险的投保人给予保险合同约定外利益,累计金额47.86万元。","quote_span":{"start":314,"end":387,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"兼业代理渠道向购买车险投保人赠送油卡、代金券，明确为保险合同外利益。","limitations":"限于赠礼销售事实，不推断任何无条件礼品都属合同外利益。","event_family_id":"FEV-01f37d0b48918c8caa5b","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":false,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M04","mechanism":"合同外利益","file_id":"F000495","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F000495-b8bca568071b857c91cc5f42","quote":"2017年6月至7月,天安财险重庆分公司采用向投保人赠送加油卡的方式,给予投保人保险合同约定以外的其他利益。","quote_span":{"start":385,"end":439,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"车险机构向投保人赠送加油卡，明确记载合同外利益。","limitations":"付款形式为油卡；可供同机制返利参考，但未说明每张保单返还比例。","event_family_id":"FEV-710808e9f38b754fb03b","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":false,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M04","mechanism":"合同外利益","file_id":"F009589","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F009589-19dfd2130d3cb4ead62ebc3f","quote":"(二)2020年10月,投保人陈某购买了2笔保单,保单记录的销售渠道为你公司,保险销售从业人员为姚某某。2020年11月27日,在投保人陈某购买第3笔保单前,\n姚某某委托其私人助理王某某向陈某的个人账户转账3,307元,作为对投保人陈某已购买2笔保单和即将购买的第3份保单的利益返还。","quote_span":{"start":471,"end":613,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"销售人员经私人助理给投保人转账3307元，作为已购买和即将购买保单的返利；另有虚入职领佣返利。","limitations":"文书明确合同外获益对象为投保客户；不得把全部代理佣金一概视为客户返利。","event_family_id":"FEV-70b6304c20dca1da6468","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M05","mechanism":"非保证利益保证化","file_id":"F002563","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F002563-31c53dc74c45281086543382","quote":"4、营销员使用自印“尊享人生”宣传资料,保证有最低分红利率,按固定年化利率计算收益,并与银行储蓄做简单对比。","quote_span":{"start":293,"end":347,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"自印宣传资料保证最低分红利率，并用固定年化利率计算收益。","limitations":"支持分红保证化，不等同于合同固定给付本身不合法；未记具体被承诺最低率。","event_family_id":"FEV-450313cc37c9d5fca6d2","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
{"mechanism_id":"M05","mechanism":"非保证利益保证化","file_id":"F001352","source_id":"FRV2-SOURCE-F001352-e6e57f90716b099af8e93116","quote":"宣传彩页以确定收益演示红利,未揭示红利分配的不确定性。上述宣传彩页由\n该公司印制后发送至各营销服务部用于培训,且被部分营销员用于展业。","quote_span":{"start":198,"end":265,"offset_unit":"unicode_codepoint","end_exclusive":true},"fact":"公司印制培训彩页将红利按确定收益展示，未披露不确定性，部分用于展业。","limitations":"未说明具体分红率或全部培训课件均违规。","event_family_id":"FEV-447a32ede39a5736c642","event_family_status":"provisional","previous_anchor_overlap":false,"previous_pool_overlap":true,"previous_anchor_event_overlap":false,"is_query_relevance_label":false,"relevance_score":null,"source_full_text_read_by_model":true,"semantic_review_method":"逐份模型阅读全文并人工式判断动作与限制；未使用关键词自动分类或评分","human_approved":false,"human_review_status":"pending"}
